msgid "Permanently deletes comments from the database. This cannot be undone and there is no trash to recover from. Always call this with dry_run=true first to see how many comments match, show that number to the person you are helping, and only then call it again with dry_run=false and confirm=true. On a multisite network this only ever affects the site the request is made against, never other sites in the network."
